<title>USA: Freddie Mac sets $500 mln REMIC 1928.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac sets $500 mln REMIC 1928.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac or FHLMC) said it issued $500 million of Real Estate Mortgage Investment Conduit (REMIC) securities.</p>
<p>REMIC series 1928, underwritten by Goldman Sachs, is backed by 30-year single-family fixed-rate mortgages, Freddie Mac said.</p>
<p>The issue has a coupon of 7.5 percent, a pricing date of January 3 and a settlement date of January 30, FHLMC said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660))</p>
